flowchart TD
    Args[Parse args/config] --> Info{Early command?}
    Info -- yes --> Exit[Print and exit]
    Info -- no --> Input[Load input]
    Input --> Evidence[Parse evidence]
    Evidence --> Analysis[Run analysis]
    Analysis --> Attach[Attach evidence]
    Attach --> Detection[Detections and risk]
    Detection --> Intelligence[Attach Intelligence]
    Intelligence --> Enrichment[Optional enrichment]
    Enrichment --> Export[Write outputs]
